  "description": "Armour Horse is a bold western display typeface inspired by cowboy culture, rodeo traditions, frontier towns, and vintage wood-type lettering. Built with strong serif foundations, decorative spurs, and distinctive reverse-contrast details, this font delivers an authentic Wild West character while maintaining excellent readability. Its rugged yet elegant appearance makes it perfect for creating eye-catching headlines, vintage logos, labels, ranch branding, packaging, posters, apparel, signage, and other western-themed designs.\nDesigned to give you maximum creative flexibility, Armour Horse comes packed with stylistic alternates, discretionary ligatures, decorative catchwords, multilingual support, numbers, and punctuation. Whether you’re crafting a rustic brand identity, an old-town saloon poster, or a premium handcrafted product label, Armour Horse helps you create typography that feels timeless, adventurous, and full of frontier spirit. Bring the charm of the Wild West to your next project with a typeface that’s bold, memorable, and unmistakably western",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Armour Horse is a bold western display typeface inspired by cowboy culture, rodeo traditions, frontier towns, and vintage wood-type lettering. Built with strong serif foundations, decorative spurs, and distinctive reverse-contrast details, this font delivers an authentic Wild West character while maintaining excellent readability. Its rugged yet elegant appearance makes it perfect for creating eye-catching headlines, vintage logos, labels, ranch branding, packaging, posters, apparel, signage, and other western-themed designs.</p>\n<p>Designed to give you maximum creative flexibility, Armour Horse comes packed with stylistic alternates, discretionary ligatures, decorative catchwords, multilingual support, numbers, and punctuation. Whether you’re crafting a rustic brand identity, an old-town saloon poster, or a premium handcrafted product label, Armour Horse helps you create typography that feels timeless, adventurous, and full of frontier spirit. Bring the charm of the Wild West to your next project with a typeface that’s bold, memorable, and unmistakably western</p>",
